   "stem_html": "<p>The table below shows the number of checkers and the number of moves needed to win a skipping game.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Number of Checkers</th>\n      <td>\n        1\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        2\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        3\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        4\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Number of Skips Needed</th>\n      <td>\n        2\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        8\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        18\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        32\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n <br> <p>How many skips are needed with 6 checkers on each side?</p>",
